    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Fog Encounters</i>\u00a0is an intense, quick-fix horror game. You're piloting a tiny air craft until you get struck with low fuel suddenly after storming into fog. You end up landing at Bangor International's Airport only to find the place to be near-deserted, with a man calling out for help inside, you unfold an incident that occurred from a flight of missing passengers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge the airport to find the few resources you need to progress further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822640/extras/dc35ff5b08a7dc3eddb3d71f3f7fd7de.poster.webp?t=1752241457\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822640/extras/dc35ff5b08a7dc3eddb3d71f3f7fd7de.webp?t=1752241457\" class=\"bb_img\" width=608 height=400 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Counter the unhinged madman who goes by the name Lenny as he roams around the airport and shows up unexpectedly.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822640/extras/90983bfeedd8cd45087e8d306d91e4f5.poster.webp?t=1752241457\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822640/extras/90983bfeedd8cd45087e8d306d91e4f5.webp?t=1752241457\" class=\"bb_img\" width=608 height=400 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the captains plan to escape the airport.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822640/extras/af5aed8fcfb9041dea394e2fa386ccd3.poster.webp?t=1752241457\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822640/extras/af5aed8fcfb9041dea394e2fa386ccd3.webp?t=1752241457\" class=\"bb_img\" width=608 height=400 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eerie atmospheric yet visible setting in a near-empty airport map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two choices that lead to multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear storyline with trackable objectives list</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One main enemy AI that will hunt and chase you down</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple physics system to help protect yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will be free to play on itch.\u00a0<br>If you want to support me as a solo indie dev you can purchase it on steam.<br>Note: This is my first game I've ever made, expect bugs.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Fog Encounters</i>\u00a0is an intense, quick-fix horror game. You're piloting a tiny air craft until you get struck with low fuel suddenly after storming into fog. You end up landing at Bangor International's Airport only to find the place to be near-deserted, with a man calling out for help inside, you unfold an incident that occurred from a flight of missing passengers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge the airport to find the few resources you need to progress further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822640/extras/dc35ff5b08a7dc3eddb3d71f3f7fd7de.poster.webp?t=1752241457\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822640/extras/dc35ff5b08a7dc3eddb3d71f3f7fd7de.webp?t=1752241457\" class=\"bb_img\" width=608 height=400 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Counter the unhinged madman who goes by the name Lenny as he roams around the airport and shows up unexpectedly.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822640/extras/90983bfeedd8cd45087e8d306d91e4f5.poster.webp?t=1752241457\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822640/extras/90983bfeedd8cd45087e8d306d91e4f5.webp?t=1752241457\" class=\"bb_img\" width=608 height=400 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the captains plan to escape the airport.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822640/extras/af5aed8fcfb9041dea394e2fa386ccd3.poster.webp?t=1752241457\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822640/extras/af5aed8fcfb9041dea394e2fa386ccd3.webp?t=1752241457\" class=\"bb_img\" width=608 height=400 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eerie atmospheric yet visible setting in a near-empty airport map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two choices that lead to multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear storyline with trackable objectives list</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One main enemy AI that will hunt and chase you down</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple physics system to help protect yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will be free to play on itch.\u00a0<br>If you want to support me as a solo indie dev you can purchase it on steam.<br>Note: This is my first game I've ever made, expect bugs.</p>",
